\doxysubsection{Detailed Description}
DC motor feedforward controller. 

Implements a feedforward control law for DC motors based on the motor\textquotesingle{}s physical characteristics. The controller calculates the voltage needed to achieve a desired acceleration and velocity, accounting for back-\/\+EMF, acceleration torque, and static friction. 

